{"id":"n2-006","title":"A すなわち B。 (A sunawachi B)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Express that A is equivalent to B; 'in other words', 'namely', 'that is to say'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point A すなわち B is used to express that two phrases are equivalent or that the second phrase is further explanation, clarification or the true meaning of the first phrase. This can be translated as 'in other words', 'namely', or 'that is to say' in English.","formation":"Phrase A + すなわち + Phrase B","examples":[{"jp":"私は立派な成果を出したい、すなわち、成功したいのです。","romaji":"Watashi wa rippana seika wo dashitai, sunawachi, seikou shitai no desu.","en":"I want to achieve great results, in other words, I want to succeed.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"立派","vocabId":"1551790","reading":"りっぱ"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"成果","vocabId":"1375650","reading":"せいか"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出し","vocabId":"1339160","reading":"だし","baseForm":"出す"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すなわち","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[9]},{"jp":"彼は言葉に詰まった、すなわち、何も言えなかった。","romaji":"Kare wa kotoba ni tsumatta, sunawachi, nani mo ienakatta.","en":"He was at a loss for words, that is to say, he couldn't say anything.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言葉","vocabId":"1264540","reading":"ことば"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"詰まっ","vocabId":"1226480","reading":"つまる","baseForm":"詰まる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すなわち","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言え","vocabId":"1008860","reading":"いえる","baseForm":"言える"},{"surface":"なかっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]},{"jp":"彼女は自分の目標に向かって努力し続けている、すなわち、彼女は非常に頑張っている。","romaji":"Kanojo wa jibun no mokuhyou ni mukatte doryoku shi tsudzukete iru, sunawachi, kanojo wa hijou ni ganbatte iru.","en":"She keeps working hard towards her goals, namely, she is trying very hard.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"自分","vocabId":"1318610","reading":"じぶん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"目標","vocabId":"1535650","reading":"もくひょう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"向かっ","vocabId":"1604800","reading":"むかう","baseForm":"向かう"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"努力","vocabId":"1445130","reading":"どりょく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"続け","vocabId":"1405800","reading":"つづける","baseForm":"続ける"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すなわち","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"非常","vocabId":"1484920","reading":"ひじょう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"頑張っ","vocabId":"1217700","reading":"がんばる","baseForm":"頑張る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[14]},{"jp":"この店はお客様の満足を一番大事にしています、すなわち、サービスが良いということです。","romaji":"Kono mise wa okyakusama no manzoku o ichiban daiji ni shiteimasu, sunawachi, saabisu ga yoi to iu koto desu.","en":"This store values customer satisfaction above all else, in other words, it has good service.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surfa